  "inputs": {
    "notes": [
      "Introduce/normalize GateDecision artifact: decision (ALLOW|DENY), reason_codes[], decision_trace (5\u201310 lines).",
      "On DENY: include next_base_ref/patch pointer for ITERATE.",
